  },
  {
    "title": "Doodle 3 — Doodle Maker Pen",
    "content": "**Look:** A chunky pen that's doodling a snowflake onto a blank page, sparkles flying. Black outline, icy blue ink trail, warm paper white.\n**Where:** Doodle Maker app icon + empty-state illustration.\n**Vibe:** 'Your doodle starts here — anything can be drawn.'"
  },
  {
    "title": "Doodle 4 — Comic Maker Panel",
