  },
  {
    "title": "Doodle 7 — Cab-Net Arcade Cabinet",
    "content": "**Look:** A classic arcade cabinet with a screen showing two tiny figures facing off (Hood vs Fridge), joystick + buttons below. Black outline, neon red vs icy blue split screen.\n**Where:** Cab-Net Clash promo game icon.\n**Vibe:** 'The cabinet originals vs the suburbs — insert coin.'"
  },
  {
    "title": "Doodle 8 — Neon Night Cassette",
    "content": "**Look:** A cassette glowing with neon pink/purple light, musical notes rising like city lights. Black outline, neon gradient accents.\n**Where:** Spread Da Word Neon Night soundtrack theme + playlist art.\n**Vibe:** 'Late night, city lights, cold beats.'"
  },
  {
    "title": "Doodle 9 — Beat Paw (Snow Beats)",
    "content": "**Look:** A cute snowman paw tapping a beat pad, tiny 'thump' rings radiating. Black outline, icy blue pad, red scarf flash.\n**Where:** Snow Beats download success toast + beat pad UI.\n**Vibe:** 'One tap. That's a beat.'"
